    "title": "In a Racy Gown, Dua Lipa Begins Celebrating Her 30th Birthday Early - NewsBreak",
    "text": "The festivities for Dua Lipa ‘s 30th birthday are getting underway early! Wearing a risqué white cutout gown, the singer celebrated her milestone birthday on vacation with her loved ones on August 22. She shared a number of photos from a beautiful location. Along with her mother Anesa Lipa and sister Rina Lipa, Lipa was joined in the festivities by her fiancé, actor Callum Turner. On Tuesday, August 12, the musician was rewarded with a chocolate birthday cake adorned with redcurrants, raspberries, and cherries while posing in front of a pool while wearing the Jacquemus garment. The images were posted on Instagram. As everyone around her applauded, Lipa was seen blowing out a solitary candle on the cake in a video that her friend Marco Maestri took and put on her Instagram Stories. As they posed for a picture in front of a villa’s pool, she also relished a warm moment with Turner, 35, who slyly put his hand on his fiancée’s butt. The post In a Racy Gown, Dua Lipa Begins Celebrating Her 30th Birthday Early appeared first on BlackSportsOnline .",
